### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get current user (replace TOKEN with actual token from login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY5ODIzMDI2M2ZhYjQ4NWRkZDNmYzQ4ZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MDEzOTcyNCwiZXhwIjoxNzcwNzQ0NTI0fQ.t6QgpywRrM12BYlbn10cS_gipXed7O2gHA2maipS3U8

### Create a todo (with auth token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY5ODIzMDI2M2ZhYjQ4NWRkZDNmYzQ4ZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MDEzOTcyNCwiZXhwIjoxNzcwNzQ0NTI0fQ.t6QgpywRrM12BYlbn10cS_gipXed7O2gHA2maipS3U8

{
  "name": "Test Todo",
  "description": "This is a test",
  "dueDate": "2024-12-31",
  "status": "Not Started"
}

### Get all todos (with auth token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY5ODIzMDI2M2ZhYjQ4NWRkZDNmYzQ4ZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MDEzOTcyNCwiZXhwIjoxNzcwNzQ0NTI0fQ.t6QgpywRrM12BYlbn10cS_gipXed7O2gHA2maipS3U8